{"_id":"694968063eeddc26d7c31d75","roadmapSlug":"django","nodeId":"K2dNQ69laFT853CFniJrZ","description":"# pytest\n\npytest is a popular Python testing framework that simplifies writing and running tests. It offers features like auto-discovery of test functions, simple assertion syntax, extensive plugin support, and detailed error reporting. pytest aims to make testing more efficient and readable, allowing developers to focus on verifying the correctness of their code.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"pytest docs","url":"https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/","_id":"6a7f4a75cb44947debcf7032"},{"type":"official","title":"pytest-django Documentation∩âü","url":"https://pytest-django.readthedocs.io/en/latest/","_id":"6a7f4a75cb44947debcf7033"},{"type":"opensource","title":"pytest","url":"https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest","_id":"6a7f4a75cb44947debcf7034"},{"type":"article","title":"Hands On Guide to Unit Testing with Pytest and Django","url":"https://klementomeri.medium.com/path-to-tight-sleep-with-test-automation-81916b567745","_id":"6a7f4a75cb44947debcf7035"},{"type":"article","title":"How to Use Pytest for Unit Testing","url":"https://www.datacamp.com/tutorial/pytest-tutorial-a-hands-on-guide-to-unit-testing","_id":"6a7f4a75cb44947debcf7036"},{"type":"video","title":"Pytest Mastery with Django","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LYX6nlECcro&list=PLOLrQ9Pn6caw3ilqDR8_qezp76QuEOlHY","_id":"6a7f4a75cb44947debcf7037"},{"type":"video","title":"Re-Write Django tests with pytest | pytest fixtures & test functions","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pdatgYDXmSE","_id":"6a7f4a75cb44947debcf7038"}],"createdAt":"2025-12-22T15:47:18.910Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:03:49.335Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/django/content/K2dNQ69laFT853CFniJrZ.md"}